00392:       "text": "  def level=(value)\n    if value < 1 || value > GameData::GrowthRate.max_level\n      raise ArgumentError.new(_INTL(\"The level number ({1}) is invalid.\", value))\n    end\n    @exp = growth_rate.minimum_exp_for_level(value)\n    @level = value\n  end\n",
